  "description": "Production observability dashboard for Kovanica JSON-RPC & WebSocket server (kovanica-rpc): p50/p95/p99 request latency histograms, slow-RPC tracking (>500ms), batch throughput and rejections, and WebSocket active connections, cap rejections, and lagged message drops.",
